Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.98,0:00:04.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Now everybody lift your hands up!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.28,0:00:06.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Sing about what you are dreaming!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.38,0:00:07.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Always stand up!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.94,0:00:09.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Raise up the flag that can't be beaten!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.00,0:00:11.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Gotta keep up!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.60,0:00:15.70,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll get past every wall that's\Nin our wake, go without hesitation!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.78,0:00:16.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Hands up!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.86,0:00:29.18,Default,,0,0,0,,We just have to press on a little\Nmore To get to the answers we're
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.26,0:00:36.06,Default,,0,0,0,,looking for We came to this new world\Nbelieving That surely someday we
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.14,0:00:41.82,Default,,0,0,0,,just might find the way All the\Npieces of our dreams have now come
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.90,0:00:46.08,Default,,0,0,0,,together Our bonds won't waver With
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.16,0:00:49.88,Default,,0,0,0,,our dreaming hand Let's head on towards
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.66,0:00:56.54,Default,,0,0,0,,A bright new future Now\Neverybody lift your hands up
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.62,0:01:00.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Sing about what you are dreaming\NAlways stand up Raise up
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.92,0:01:04.78,Default,,0,0,0,,the flag that you believe in\NGotta keep up We'll get past
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.86,0:01:08.42,Default,,0,0,0,,everyone that's in our way\NLet's head on never stopping
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.68,0:01:16.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Only look up Keep your head up way up\Nhigh Always step up If waves are rough,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.20,0:01:19.48,Default,,0,0,0,,jump to the sky Never give up Our wishes,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.56,0:01:23.18,Default,,0,0,0,,they will come together And\Nlead us on for the future
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.70,0:01:29.04,Default,,0,0,0,,We drift on riding the\Nwaves Towards another
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.12,0:01:33.42,Default,,0,0,0,,shore day by day There are many meetings,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.72,0:01:37.84,Default,,0,0,0,,many goodbyes Underneath the flag we fly
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.06,0:01:47.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll remember the pain within I'll keep\Nit in my heart forever And never take it
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.74,0:01:53.32,Default,,0,0,0,,lightly But I won't surrender This freedom\NI will keep in mind I'll keep holding on,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.40,0:01:57.92,Default,,0,0,0,,never stop it Now everybody\Nlift your hands up Sing
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.00,0:02:01.54,Default,,0,0,0,,about what you are dreaming\NAlways stand up Raise
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.62,0:02:05.24,Default,,0,0,0,,up the flag that you believe\Nin Gotta keep up We'll
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.32,0:02:08.24,Default,,0,0,0,,get past everyone that's\Nin our way Let's head on,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.32,0:02:09.84,Default,,0,0,0,,never stop it
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.84,0:02:16.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Only look up, keep your head\Nup way up high Always step up,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.24,0:02:19.74,Default,,0,0,0,,if brains are rough, jump\Nto the sky Never give up,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.94,0:02:24.14,Default,,0,0,0,,our wishes they will come together\NAnd lead us on for the future
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.00,0:02:26.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Hands up
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.72,0:02:45.60,Default,,0,0,0,,hey what the hell was that for\Nlisten huh he was talking I
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.68,0:02:51.60,Default,,0,0,0,,heard him yeah I think the heat's\Ngetting to you pal I don't know
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.68,0:02:58.42,Default,,0,0,0,,maybe it is even a dragon it\Ncould be something way more
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.50,0:03:04.20,Default,,0,0,0,,dangerous this sure looks like\None though doesn't it it It does,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.42,0:03:05.89,Default,,0,0,0,,that's a dragon for sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.06,0:03:08.30,Default,,0,0,0,,A lizard-like body with massive wings.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.60,0:03:12.25,Default,,0,0,0,,That's exactly the way dragons\Nare described in all the myths.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.20,0:03:21.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh-oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.74,0:03:34.86,Default,,0,0,0,,So it can breathe fire, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.96,0:03:36.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.98,0:03:38.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.30,0:03:43.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know what I was\Nexpecting, but come on really.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.74,0:03:48.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Bring it on!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.24,0:03:53.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, Gum-Gum!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.84,0:03:57.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Jet bullet!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.94,0:04:05.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no! Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.16,0:04:08.02,Default,,0,0,0,,You got some thick skin, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.46,0:04:12.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Look! Behind you!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.06,0:04:22.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.68,0:04:31.50,Default,,0,0,0,,It sees us!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.70,0:04:33.72,Default,,0,0,0,,You're mine!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.08,0:04:45.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Patty!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.24,0:04:46.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I can sense your presence!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.46,0:04:49.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Here!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.04,0:04:57.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, I see now.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.58,0:05:00.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy was right, that\Nthing really can talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.48,0:05:05.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Dreeshort style...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.74,0:05:07.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Ultra Tiger Trap!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.96,0:05:34.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.62,0:05:36.72,Default,,0,0,0,,This guy is one stubborn lizard!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.12,0:05:43.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Back off!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.56,0:05:58.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy! Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.94,0:06:01.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I heard him talk too.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.38,0:06:03.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I told ya!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.88,0:06:05.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I heard it too! But how?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.16,0:06:22.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, great!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.50,0:06:23.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Now he's flying!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.64,0:06:27.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Patty!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.92,0:06:30.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you also allies of the Seven Warlords?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.24,0:06:49.07,Default,,0,0,0,,It's hot!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.50,0:06:50.82,Default,,0,0,0,,It worse than that!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.16,0:06:52.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Talking Dragon!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.50,0:07:03.64,Default,,0,0,0,,He mentioned the Seven Warlords,\Nso could he be an enemy of theirs?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.52,0:07:16.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy, just leave this blowhard to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.60,0:07:20.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll cut him to pieces in no time.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.12,0:07:22.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure, go ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.00,0:07:26.08,Default,,0,0,0,,But first...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.16,0:07:28.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Ow, ow, ow, ow, ow!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.28,0:07:30.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me bring him to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.08,0:07:48.78,Default,,0,0,0,,It feels like he's on fire, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.20,0:07:57.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.46,0:08:02.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Patty!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.54,0:08:05.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I feel a breeze all of\Na sudden. How curious!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.66,0:08:07.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.64,0:08:10.74,Default,,0,0,0,,The flames are nipping at my tender flesh.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.38,0:08:14.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Have mercy!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.06,0:08:16.50,Default,,0,0,0,,The tickles! Patty!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.88,0:08:21.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Stand down!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.52,0:08:23.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Such dishonorable behavior!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.02,0:08:24.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.93,0:08:26.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I was right!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.58,0:08:27.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.24,0:08:29.66,Default,,0,0,0,,You won't believe this!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.74,0:08:34.32,Default,,0,0,0,,There's some weird fancy pants guy\Nstuck in the dragon's back! Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.66,0:08:36.66,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell is he talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.82,0:08:39.86,Default,,0,0,0,,That means the voice we've\Nbeen hearing must be...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.80,0:08:48.98,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, that's enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.58,0:08:53.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Eat this if you're hungry!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.74,0:09:01.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Hehehe!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.78,0:09:12.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Hehehehe!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.56,0:09:13.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Stupid!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.24,0:09:21.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.30,0:09:23.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Heads up!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.40,0:09:25.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.24,0:09:31.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Usopp!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.50,0:09:34.30,Default,,0,0,0,,You got it!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.08,0:09:37.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Special attack, Green Star!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.72,0:09:42.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Trampolia!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.06,0:09:58.38,Default,,0,0,0,,One-sword style!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.66,0:10:06.10,Default,,0,0,0,,E .I.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.30,0:10:15.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Death Lion Song, you're done.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.04,0:10:27.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.92,0:10:28.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Zoro!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.86,0:10:37.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I bet this thing is delicious!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.72,0:10:41.12,Default,,0,0,0,,There's enough fire around to barbecue it!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.20,0:10:42.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Now you're talking!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.54,0:10:47.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Here, see any floor.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.30,0:11:01.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Nummies one!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.32,0:11:06.84,Default,,0,0,0,,A cold crepe to go with\Nthe shellfish just for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.02,0:11:10.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I got some champagne, too! Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.60,0:11:14.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, are you guys sleeping?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.62,0:11:21.98,Default,,0,0,0,,It's foggy.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.70,0:11:33.84,Default,,0,0,0,,That's not fog, damn I\Nalready inhaled some of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.92,0:11:35.88,Default,,0,0,0,,It's some kind of sleeping gas.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.96,0:11:38.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Is this just a normal\Noccurrence in the new world?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.16,0:11:43.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Or did somebody sneak onto the ship?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.40,0:11:51.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I hope the rest of the crew took a baby\Ntransponder snail to the island with them.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.70,0:11:59.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I have to find a way to tell them.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.72,0:12:37.90,Default,,0,0,0,,we've got two humans one
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.98,0:12:41.40,Default,,0,0,0,,cyborg and some sort of pet
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.98,0:12:49.56,Default,,0,0,0,,tie them all up right right it's a
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.64,0:12:52.04,Default,,0,0,0,,good thing they're just low-life pirates
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.26,0:12:57.48,Default,,0,0,0,,so no one's even going to\Nmiss them how convenient
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.08,0:13:16.16,Default,,0,0,0,,The master will be pleased with this.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.52,0:13:26.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Pull him out!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.80,0:13:28.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurt!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.71,0:13:29.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Unhand me, you ruffling!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.08,0:13:31.80,Default,,0,0,0,,How dare you! Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.04,0:13:33.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm trying to help you here!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.14,0:13:34.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop squirming!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.58,0:13:35.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.60,0:13:45.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I broke him! Sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.16,0:13:48.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry is all you have to say!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.54,0:13:50.00,Default,,0,0,0,,He's dead now!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.06,0:13:56.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, seems I've been liberated.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.28,0:13:58.11,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.48,0:14:02.70,Default,,0,0,0,,He's still alive and his legs can talk?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.00,0:14:04.02,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a monster!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.24,0:14:05.12,Default,,0,0,0,,A zombie!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.34,0:14:08.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.92,0:14:10.74,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no upper body anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.82,0:14:14.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Nor is there a mark on the\Ndragon where he was stuck. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.30,0:14:16.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I don't get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.42,0:14:20.38,Default,,0,0,0,,So, then the guy was just legs all along?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.72,0:14:23.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Ugh, this is pretty weird, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.74,0:14:27.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh, he looks kind of big.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.18,0:14:33.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I know you were there, but I\Ncannot discern your intent.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.04,0:14:37.51,Default,,0,0,0,,With neither eyes nor ears, I\Ncan only sense your presence.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.74,0:14:39.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow, you're smart!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.34,0:14:40.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, for legs...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.32,0:14:41.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Root!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.23,0:14:42.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoever you are, get out of my way!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.38,0:14:45.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Calm down!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.54,0:14:47.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I refuse to die in a place like this!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.96,0:14:49.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I have a mission to carry out!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.84,0:14:50.84,Default,,0,0,0,,He's running away!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.92,0:14:52.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I will not suffer this indignity!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.22,0:14:54.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Prepare yourself, Warlord!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.24,0:14:56.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm coming for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.54,0:14:59.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.82,0:15:01.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Lex, come and join my crowd!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.14,0:15:03.46,Default,,0,0,0,,You cut that out!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.74,0:15:05.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.14,0:15:07.98,Default,,0,0,0,,So how does that work?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.02,0:15:10.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Beats me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.86,0:15:12.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Nice job.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.36,0:15:13.58,Default,,0,0,0,,This dragon's good.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.64,0:15:17.60,Default,,0,0,0,,By the way, what do you\Ncall people like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.22,0:15:20.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.16,0:15:21.70,Default,,0,0,0,,With four legs?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.54,0:15:25.32,Default,,0,0,0,,A centaur, I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.20,0:15:29.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm a centaur!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.94,0:15:31.00,Default,,0,0,0,,This is awesome!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.94,0:15:35.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Why do these legs keep getting stuck?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.36,0:15:37.50,Default,,0,0,0,,First a dragon, now Luffy?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.68,0:15:40.26,Default,,0,0,0,,We're a team now!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.96,0:15:41.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Curses!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.87,0:15:46.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I seem to have affixed myself to\Nsomething again. Boot! Cease this!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.10,0:15:49.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy, that's vulgar. Stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.70,0:15:50.64,Default,,0,0,0,,You think so?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.00,0:15:58.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Just cause he's stuck to you\Ndoesn't mean he has to listen.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.28,0:16:01.04,Default,,0,0,0,,He's probably got his own head\Ncalling the shot somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.12,0:16:03.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Let him go and maybe he'll find it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.00,0:16:06.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.91,0:16:08.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Sticky Legs was born like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.26,0:16:09.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Duh.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.17,0:16:13.48,Default,,0,0,0,,You need to get with the program, Usopp,\Nright? Come on. That's ridiculous.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.90,0:16:16.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, are you coming with us or what?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.08,0:16:17.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I wonder if he's got a real name.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.76,0:16:18.59,Default,,0,0,0,,By the way,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.67,0:16:20.91,Default,,0,0,0,,since you're the only one who's\Ngoing to be eating all this meat,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.00,0:16:22.14,Default,,0,0,0,,why don't you carry it?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.22,0:16:23.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Get the legs to help.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.34,0:16:30.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, come up here.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.64,0:16:32.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I found something weird. Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.70,0:16:35.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Any clues about the\Nsamurai or the other dude?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.22,0:16:38.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Look.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.06,0:16:41.14,Default,,0,0,0,,What now?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.02,0:16:43.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Snow!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.60,0:16:46.74,Default,,0,0,0,,There's snow on those mountains!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.00,0:16:52.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Actually, I think those are glaciers.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.10,0:16:58.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Everything's on fire over here, but the\Nother side of the lake is frozen solid?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.78,0:17:02.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I could go for some cool weather\Nright now, but this is ridiculous.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.68,0:17:04.22,Default,,0,0,0,,How did it get like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.30,0:17:07.80,Default,,0,0,0,,That solves one mystery,\Nat least. Like what?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.22,0:17:09.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.48,0:17:11.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Why that guy said he was cold, you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.00,0:17:14.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Someone help!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.62,0:17:17.22,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong? Please! It's cold!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.52,0:17:18.80,Default,,0,0,0,,We need boss!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.18,0:17:22.74,Default,,0,0,0,,My friends are getting cut\Ndown, one after another!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.00,0:17:25.30,Default,,0,0,0,,The samurai is gonna kill us!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.46,0:17:30.74,Default,,0,0,0,,So then, if we want to find the samurai\Nand the other guy, we have to switch sides.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.38,0:17:36.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow, this place is fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.56,0:17:38.33,Default,,0,0,0,,We can cross that lake, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.50,0:17:39.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm getting hot.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.92,0:17:41.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to make snow cones.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.20,0:17:43.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Get real.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.18,0:17:45.02,Default,,0,0,0,,We'd freeze to death over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.10,0:17:46.28,Default,,0,0,0,,The lake's too big.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.54,0:17:48.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go back for now. Cold, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.04,0:17:50.39,Default,,0,0,0,,That's not much better.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.54,0:17:51.38,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.46,0:17:54.82,Default,,0,0,0,,If we can find some wild animals,\Nwe can skin them and make coats.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.90,0:17:55.73,Default,,0,0,0,,You're nuts.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.86,0:17:58.64,Default,,0,0,0,,The only thing we'll find\Nover there is ice cubes.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.72,0:18:00.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Perfect for snow cones.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.36,0:18:02.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, can't we talk this over, Luffy?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.24,0:18:25.32,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.40,0:18:29.62,Default,,0,0,0,,There was a bird, only it\Nwas also a human somehow.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.78,0:18:31.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know, it was weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.12,0:18:33.86,Default,,0,0,0,,The point is, this island is full of\Nmonsters and they're gonna eat us for sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.94,0:18:35.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, there's nothing there.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.82,0:18:51.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, Sanji, what's all\Nthis kicking about, man?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.48,0:18:52.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Good, you're up.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.26,0:18:54.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Can't you see for yourself?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.98,0:18:56.70,Default,,0,0,0,,They locked us up, Franky!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.04,0:18:58.66,Default,,0,0,0,,We're done for, I tell you!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.80,0:18:59.68,Default,,0,0,0,,We're done for!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.68,0:19:02.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.32,0:19:05.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.23,0:19:06.37,Default,,0,0,0,,What the heck happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.46,0:19:08.26,Default,,0,0,0,,What is this freaky place?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.48,0:19:11.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I know, I was eating dessert\Non the deck of the Sunny,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.88,0:19:14.52,Default,,0,0,0,,and then I, I don't remember anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.60,0:19:19.02,Default,,0,0,0,,None of us do; we must have\Nbeen hit with sleeping gas,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.10,0:19:22.98,Default,,0,0,0,,then when we passed out, someone must\Nhave dragged us off to this place.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.06,0:19:26.74,Default,,0,0,0,,No way—I do remember the ship\Ngetting hit with some kind of gas.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.82,0:19:30.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry if I'd noticed it\Nsooner; we wouldn't be here.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.94,0:19:31.77,Default,,0,0,0,,here
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.22,0:19:46.08,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't break out, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.08,0:19:51.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe they want to sell us\Nhis slaves or suck our blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.58,0:19:55.40,Default,,0,0,0,,If they took everyone on the sunny,\Nthen what happened to Brooke?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.84,0:19:56.67,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.75,0:19:58.54,Default,,0,0,0,,It was just us when we woke up.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.76,0:20:00.20,Default,,0,0,0,,It's because he's a skeleton.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.28,0:20:03.28,Default,,0,0,0,,He doesn't have any blood\Nto drink, so they left him.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.36,0:20:05.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you think they'll drink my cola too?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.44,0:20:06.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Both of you!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.92,0:20:07.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.28,0:20:09.32,Default,,0,0,0,,May I speak?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.98,0:20:12.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, who is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.98,0:20:15.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure, wasn't me?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.26,0:20:16.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Show yourself, bro!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.78,0:20:19.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I know not from where you hail.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.68,0:20:21.20,Default,,0,0,0,,But if you're proficient in puzzles?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.28,0:20:23.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I have one in the form of my head.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.04,0:20:29.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I think this thing is talking to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.64,0:20:33.80,Default,,0,0,0,,But what the heck is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.48,0:20:36.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I am no thing
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.60,0:20:40.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Is it a bug?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.02,0:20:42.28,Default,,0,0,0,,But it talks.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.04,0:20:44.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Like a transponder snail?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.30,0:20:46.56,Default,,0,0,0,,We're outnumbered.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.66,0:20:48.04,Default,,0,0,0,,There are eight of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.12,0:20:49.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm no insect either.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.94,0:20:54.94,Default,,0,0,0,,That aside, it appears that you\Npeople are trustworthy enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.32,0:20:58.32,Default,,0,0,0,,What you see on the floor\Nare pieces of my face.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.78,0:21:02.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I beg of you, please put\Nthem back together for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.54,0:21:03.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Your face?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.14,0:21:05.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.20,0:21:06.34,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a mouth.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.58,0:21:07.66,Default,,0,0,0,,And an eye.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.24,0:21:09.26,Default,,0,0,0,,How's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.94,0:21:12.12,Default,,0,0,0,,There. Done.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.46,0:21:13.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, that's a face.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.12,0:21:16.90,Default,,0,0,0,,You left out a fair\Nnumber of parts, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.62,0:21:19.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me try.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.34,0:21:22.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Better?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.74,0:21:24.32,Default,,0,0,0,,This doesn't feel right.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.66,0:21:25.56,Default,,0,0,0,,No, no, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.74,0:21:27.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Watch, this is how you do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.04,0:21:30.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I dig that.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.50,0:21:31.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.42,0:21:33.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, let me try.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.74,0:21:35.44,Default,,0,0,0,,This is my face.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.70,0:21:37.28,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not a toy.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.76,0:21:38.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.02,0:21:41.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.46,0:21:44.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Looking pretty human, bro.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.66,0:21:51.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I believe my chin and hair may still\Nbe somewhat awry, but it's good enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.36,0:21:52.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm grateful.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.72,0:21:56.16,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a severed head! Clearly.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.80,0:21:58.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, are you a ghost?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.42,0:21:59.46,Default,,0,0,0,,How can you talk?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.38,0:22:01.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I wish I knew that.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.88,0:22:05.06,Default,,0,0,0,,A swordsman cut me into many pieces.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.38,0:22:10.34,Default,,0,0,0,,That villain, he used\Nsome manner of sorcery.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.54,0:22:13.02,Default,,0,0,0,,He severed my limbs, but I did not bleed.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.64,0:22:14.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I did not die.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.02,0:22:17.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I was denied a warrior's death.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.54,0:22:19.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Instead, I suffered this indignity.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.28,0:22:21.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm a disgrace.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.74,0:22:28.60,Default,,0,0,0,,One, two, three.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.28,0:22:31.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Three.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.19,0:22:32.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Four intruders.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.98,0:22:40.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, did you find them?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.36,0:22:43.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, they're right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.50,0:22:45.79,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got all four of them in my sights.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.92,0:22:48.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll take them out. Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.34,0:22:50.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.00,0:22:54.70,Default,,0,0,0,,You have fun with that.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.78,0:22:57.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Give me a ring when you're\Ndone, all right? Roger.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.08,0:23:18.24,Default,,0,0,0,,So this guy cut you you're\Nstill alive even without a body.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.50,0:23:19.46,Default,,0,0,0,,That's crazy
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.48,0:23:22.56,Default,,0,0,0,,It's like buggy creepy
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.52,0:23:27.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Under different circumstances, I'd\Nslit my belly and die and mourned.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.90,0:23:32.78,Default,,0,0,0,,But alas, there's something that I must\Ndo, even if I'm forced to live in disgrace!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.66,0:23:41.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.76,0:23:44.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Old man, can you tell us\Nanything about this place?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.80,0:23:45.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Old man, you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.20,0:23:48.66,Default,,0,0,0,,You need to show some respect, you woman!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.74,0:23:50.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm a proud warrior, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.00,0:23:54.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Where I'm from, women are\Nchaste, and they are modest.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.54,0:23:57.54,Default,,0,0,0,,They walk three steps behind the men. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.02,0:24:02.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Too bad. I don't care.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.12,0:24:05.20,Default,,0,0,0,,You're just a head. Be grateful.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.48,0:24:08.10,Default,,0,0,0,,We easily could have kept\Nyou in pieces on the floor.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.18,0:24:09.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Unhand me, you damn harlot!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.02,0:24:12.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow, you really don't get it, do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.16,0:24:15.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I said unhand me! Curse you!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.12,0:24:20.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Is this proper, where you come from?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.22,0:24:23.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I've never suffered such rudeness.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.42,0:24:27.38,Default,,0,0,0,,However, it seems your clothes\Nwere torn from your body,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.46,0:24:29.81,Default,,0,0,0,,so perhaps I should be more sympathetic.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.26,0:24:35.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I chose this outfit myself,\Nthank you very much. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.32,0:24:37.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, but I look good.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.16,0:24:39.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Your attire is obscene.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.18,0:24:42.24,Default,,0,0,0,,All you're wearing is a breast band.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.32,0:24:43.67,Default,,0,0,0,,You like it, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.40,0:24:46.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, indeed I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.30,0:24:47.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I know that look!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.44,0:24:54.80,Default,,0,0,0,,You pervert!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.20,0:25:08.64,Default,,0,0,0,,That was a trap!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.98,0:25:11.54,Default,,0,0,0,,You must have cracked your skull!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.80,0:25:14.26,Default,,0,0,0,,That looks painful! Yes! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.76,0:25:17.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, uh, it's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.54,0:25:19.18,Default,,0,0,0,,It barely tickles.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.96,0:25:21.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.94,0:25:25.24,Default,,0,0,0,,So a breast band is\Nappropriate in your land.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.58,0:25:26.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I approve.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.02,0:25:28.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't care what you think!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.72,0:25:30.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, just answer me one thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.92,0:25:32.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Who are you people?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:32.68,0:25:36.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I heard our captors say that\Nyou were seized from a ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.92,0:25:38.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, that's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.18,0:25:39.18,Default,,0,0,0,,We're pirates.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.78,0:25:41.98,Default,,0,0,0,,You're pirates?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.26,0:25:45.52,Default,,0,0,0,,If only I had known sooner!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.64,0:25:49.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I loathe pirates!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.76,0:25:51.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Though I should have guessed!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.72,0:25:53.66,Default,,0,0,0,,That does explain your barbarism!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.20,0:26:02.82,Default,,0,0,0,,In this frozen hell, I thought\Nwe were all victims of fate.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.16,0:26:05.81,Default,,0,0,0,,so I had hoped that we\Ncould escape together.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.70,0:26:08.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Alas, it shan't be so!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.44,0:26:10.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.50,0:26:12.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, you lost me here!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.22,0:26:13.64,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you mean frozen?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.96,0:26:16.67,Default,,0,0,0,,This place is so hot,\Neven the sea is on fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.96,0:26:19.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, there was lava and everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.16,0:26:21.10,Default,,0,0,0,,We were sweating just on the boat.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.18,0:26:22.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Aha, I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.64,0:26:26.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Old man?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.18,0:26:31.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you see the volcano here?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.86,0:26:33.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Or feel an eruption?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.00,0:26:35.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Something like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.00,0:26:38.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I did hear a loud explosion.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.82,0:26:42.29,Default,,0,0,0,,But both the island and the\Nsea surrounding it were frozen.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.26,0:26:45.90,Default,,0,0,0,,And that is the last\Nthing I shall say to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.98,0:26:46.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Cursed pirates!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.70,0:26:48.53,Default,,0,0,0,,The sky.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.74,0:26:50.39,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought it looked strange.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.24,0:26:53.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I could tell even from the boat.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.12,0:26:58.52,Default,,0,0,0,,The flaming side that Luffy and the\Nothers went to is only half of the island.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.60,0:27:03.07,Default,,0,0,0,,The people that grabbed us took us to\Nthe other side, which is frozen solid.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:04.46,0:27:06.20,Default,,0,0,0,,We need to get out of this room.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:06.28,0:27:07.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't care how.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:07.44,0:27:09.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Then we'll find out what's going on here.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.22,0:27:13.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I get what you're saying, but I kicked it\Npretty hard, and that door isn't budding.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.90,0:27:15.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Step aside! Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.76,0:27:17.94,Default,,0,0,0,,My cola is maxed out!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:27.60,0:27:29.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa, whoa, that's a big one!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.22,0:27:33.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Ranking Radical Bee!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.34,0:27:55.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's move, brother! Damn, Franky.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:56.00,0:27:57.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Should have led with that one.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:57.80,0:28:00.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Sometimes I wish I was a cyborg, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.02,0:28:09.54,Default,,0,0,0,,So what are you gonna do?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.02,0:28:13.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Last chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.40,0:28:17.17,Default,,0,0,0,,You'd rather sit there on the\Nfloor than associate with pirates?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.96,0:28:19.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Silence! Leave me be!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.30,0:28:21.18,Default,,0,0,0,,So what?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:21.30,0:28:24.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you gonna roll out of here\Nand bite your way to freedom?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.52,0:28:26.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me go!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:28.98,0:28:30.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, Samurai, tell me!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:31.98,0:28:34.42,Default,,0,0,0,,What? Samurai? For real?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.64,0:28:39.30,Default,,0,0,0,,This topknot is a traditional\Nhairstyle in the land of Wano.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.76,0:28:43.20,Default,,0,0,0,,So, he's the one who killed those guys?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.42,0:28:44.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Does that mean he might kill us?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.00,0:28:46.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Or bite us? No!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.66,0:28:49.07,Default,,0,0,0,,What was that explosion?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.30,0:28:50.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I have no idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.64,0:28:52.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you think it was those pirates?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:52.22,0:28:53.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, they're coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.70,0:28:54.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's hurry.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.12,0:29:03.98,Default,,0,0,0,,We came here because we received a\Ndistress call from one of your victims.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:04.34,0:29:07.06,Default,,0,0,0,,You got a story you\Nwant to tell us, or not?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:07.42,0:29:09.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Sanji, come on! Leave him here!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:09.88,0:29:10.86,Default,,0,0,0,,He's our enemy!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:12.12,0:29:16.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I swear, I would not disgrace\Nmyself by killing in cold blood!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:20.08,0:29:26.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm here to save my son's life, and I\Nwould cut down anyone who stands in my way!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.46,0:29:36.29,Default,,0,0,0,,There!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:36.37,0:29:37.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't let them get away!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:43.64,0:29:44.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Those are my friends!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:45.14,0:29:46.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Cut it out, will ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.18,0:29:48.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Weapons left!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:52.70,0:29:53.98,Default,,0,0,0,,You're kidding me!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:54.20,0:29:55.68,Default,,0,0,0,,How did they get out of that room?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:55.76,0:29:58.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know, but we'd\Nbetter call the master.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.50,0:30:01.58,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell do they want from us?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.34,0:30:03.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Dawn!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:03.30,0:30:04.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait a sec!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:04.80,0:30:06.84,Default,,0,0,0,,You brought the head? Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:07.18,0:30:09.26,Default,,0,0,0,,It'll work out. Leave him to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:13.64,0:30:14.64,Default,,0,0,0,,There's a door!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:20.26,0:30:21.09,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:25.96,0:30:27.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:28.34,0:30:29.17,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:32.04,0:30:33.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello there, kids.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:34.18,0:30:35.01,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.09,0:30:35.92,Default,,0,0,0,,There's children?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:36.01,0:30:37.16,Default,,0,0,0,,They're so big.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:39.42,0:30:41.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess they're giants.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:41.46,0:30:44.06,Default,,0,0,0,,But are we in prison or daycare?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:44.24,0:30:45.92,Default,,0,0,0,,They're the biggest I've ever seen.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:46.00,0:30:48.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Did we drop anchor on an island of giants?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:48.52,0:30:51.58,Default,,0,0,0,,No, because they're are\Nregular-sized children, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:51.72,0:30:54.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, then it's some kind\Nof all-inclusive nursery?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:54.52,0:31:00.76,Default,,0,0,0,,There aren't any adults here to\Nsupervise, though, Mocha, who are they?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:00.84,0:31:02.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I've never seen them before.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:03.92,0:31:05.82,Default,,0,0,0,,You must be the ones who are frozen.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:05.90,0:31:08.10,Default,,0,0,0,,How did you escape frozen?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:08.18,0:31:10.06,Default,,0,0,0,,What is she talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:24.52,0:31:25.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Robots, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:26.20,0:31:27.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa, are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:33.72,0:31:36.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh man, these tykes really love me!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:36.74,0:31:39.33,Default,,0,0,0,,And it's all because\Nof my armored physique!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:40.76,0:31:43.54,Default,,0,0,0,,What did she mean by the\Nones who were frozen?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:44.48,0:31:46.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, a plushie!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:46.64,0:31:48.06,Default,,0,0,0,,A stuffed raccoon!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:48.38,0:31:50.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm a reindeer, okay? Too tiny!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:51.64,0:31:54.98,Default,,0,0,0,,And cute! Yeah! Help! They got me!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:55.12,0:31:56.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Close call.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:56.56,0:31:58.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure glad they're not interested in me.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:00.16,0:32:00.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Look!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:01.14,0:32:02.66,Default,,0,0,0,,His eyebrow's curly!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:03.00,0:32:04.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut up, small fry!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:04.94,0:32:06.10,Default,,0,0,0,,It's freaky!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:08.98,0:32:10.82,Default,,0,0,0,,That's it! I've had enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:13.44,0:32:15.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you know a child named Momonosuke?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:16.44,0:32:18.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I am looking for my boy!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:20.86,0:32:21.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm scared!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:22.32,0:32:23.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't have to talk!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:24.56,0:32:25.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:26.98,0:32:27.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't go!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:27.90,0:32:29.02,Default,,0,0,0,,We've got questions about the...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:29.10,0:32:30.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Come back here!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:30.86,0:32:32.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey! Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:32.50,0:32:34.46,Default,,0,0,0,,We're trying to get\Ninformation out of them!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:34.54,0:32:36.78,Default,,0,0,0,,And they won't talk if you scare them!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:38.02,0:32:40.20,Default,,0,0,0,,The door to the biscuit room is open.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:40.36,0:32:41.50,Default,,0,0,0,,They're coming for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:41.58,0:32:42.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's get moving.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:44.28,0:32:45.75,Default,,0,0,0,,It must be those pirates.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:46.02,0:32:47.61,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't let them get away.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:55.26,0:32:57.54,Default,,0,0,0,,What kind of facility is this place?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:57.74,0:32:58.94,Default,,0,0,0,,You've got to tell us!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:59.02,0:33:01.61,Default,,0,0,0,,You must aid me in my\Nsearch for Momonosuke!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:02.60,0:33:05.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought we told you\Nto keep your mouth shut!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:05.24,0:33:07.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I've been disgraced as a samurai!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:07.14,0:33:10.54,Default,,0,0,0,,All because I was\Nattacked by a woman! What?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:10.82,0:33:13.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, quit your whining, you chauvinist pig!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:13.38,0:33:15.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I knew it was them! I got them.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:18.90,0:33:19.73,Default,,0,0,0,,No, wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:20.40,0:33:21.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold your fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:21.54,0:33:26.13,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't use guns or explosives, and\Nlet's keep the gas grenades to a minimum.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:28.34,0:33:32.28,Default,,0,0,0,,The master would be furious if we\Nwere to hurt one of the children.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:39.34,0:33:42.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Be good, little boys and\Ngirls, and stay out of our way.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:42.48,0:33:44.32,Default,,0,0,0,,If you don't, you might get hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:44.40,0:33:45.64,Default,,0,0,0,,It's dangerous, kids.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:46.20,0:33:47.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:47.11,0:33:49.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Robot, did you come\Nfrom outside the island?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:49.16,0:33:50.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Yep, I sure did, buddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:51.12,0:33:53.96,Default,,0,0,0,,But let's be clear, I'm really a cyborg.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:54.08,0:33:55.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you have a ship, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:55.16,0:33:55.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Do we ever?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:56.22,0:34:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,It's called the Sunny. It's\Nthe best. Then save us. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:00.98,0:34:02.51,Default,,0,0,0,,What does he mean by that?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:02.78,0:34:05.80,Default,,0,0,0,,You have to. Please. What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:05.94,0:34:07.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Take your kids with us?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:07.26,0:34:09.44,Default,,0,0,0,,This place isn't a daycare after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:09.80,0:34:11.10,Default,,0,0,0,,No, don't leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:11.34,0:34:12.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't leave us here.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:12.62,0:34:16.64,Default,,0,0,0,,We're not sick anymore. We're\Nbetter. Promise. What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:17.34,0:34:18.40,Default,,0,0,0,,They were sick?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:27.16,0:34:28.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it, they're in the way!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:29.00,0:34:30.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't leave us behind!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:30.72,0:34:33.01,Default,,0,0,0,,We need you to help us get out of here!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:33.20,0:34:35.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, you're our only\Nhelp of getting home!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:35.86,0:34:38.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, now, children, you need to calm down.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:40.62,0:34:42.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Kids, I'm sorry, but we've got to go!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:56.16,0:34:57.24,Default,,0,0,0,,They want to come.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:57.48,0:34:59.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I think we should take them with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:59.38,0:35:00.21,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:00.29,0:35:01.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you crazy?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:01.21,0:35:03.02,Default,,0,0,0,,We don't even know how we're\Ngoing to save ourselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:03.10,0:35:07.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, even if we made it back to\Nthe ship, there's too many of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:08.10,0:35:08.94,Default,,0,0,0,,This sucks.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:09.60,0:35:11.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Something bad's going to happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:28.06,0:35:29.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Promise me!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:29.82,0:35:32.54,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll come back later and rescue us!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:35.88,0:35:37.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I know what's out there!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:37.78,0:35:40.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I've never been outside of this\Nbuilding before, but I know!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:40.98,0:35:43.69,Default,,0,0,0,,There's nothing else on\Nthis island, is there?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:43.88,0:35:45.06,Default,,0,0,0,,There are no cities!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:45.52,0:35:46.82,Default,,0,0,0,,No people either!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:47.92,0:35:50.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Because nobody came to help us!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:50.64,0:35:53.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to go home and see\Nmy mommy and daddy again!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:54.50,0:35:55.94,Default,,0,0,0,,You can leave now!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:56.24,0:35:57.77,Default,,0,0,0,,But you have to come back!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:58.42,0:36:00.76,Default,,0,0,0,,You're the only ones who can save us!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:03.60,0:36:04.43,Default,,0,0,0,,That's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:05.42,0:36:06.78,Default,,0,0,0,,We're not leaving them.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:07.12,0:36:09.00,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell's gotten into you?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:09.24,0:36:11.53,Default,,0,0,0,,We don't even know if they need saving!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:11.76,0:36:13.29,Default,,0,0,0,,They told us they're sick!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:13.54,0:36:15.56,Default,,0,0,0,,For all we know, this could be a hospital!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:15.64,0:36:17.12,Default,,0,0,0,,We've just met these kids.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:17.20,0:36:19.06,Default,,0,0,0,,We don't know who they\Nare, why they're here.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:19.14,0:36:21.74,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not our job to\Nhelp everybody. We meet?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:21.82,0:36:27.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I understand that Sanji\Nand I know it's risky,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:28.06,0:36:32.00,Default,,0,0,0,,but there's no way that I can\Nturn my back on these children.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:32.08,0:36:35.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Not when we are they're\Nonly hope of getting help.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:35.08,0:36:40.66,Default,,0,0,0,,We've got to do something and fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:40.74,0:36:42.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Those brats are in the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:42.10,0:36:43.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Who cares?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:43.16,0:36:44.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Go ahead and shoot them too.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:44.54,0:36:45.37,Default,,0,0,0,,But the master will?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:45.45,0:36:46.28,Default,,0,0,0,,He'll be angry.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:46.37,0:36:47.79,Default,,0,0,0,,He'll be angrier if they escape!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:54.32,0:36:57.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Nice one, son, to eat\Ntheir butts, Billy Browse!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:58.58,0:37:02.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Diabless Shambi Collier Strike!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:06.42,0:37:07.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow, cool!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:07.78,0:37:08.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Impressive.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:08.84,0:37:12.02,Default,,0,0,0,,That fellow is very strong. Aw, damn.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:13.50,0:37:14.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:14.44,0:37:16.50,Default,,0,0,0,,That's called Kung-Fu Point.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:17.00,0:37:19.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Look at that! Wahoo! Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:21.50,0:37:22.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:22.88,0:37:24.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Way to go, Raccoon!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:25.94,0:37:27.80,Default,,0,0,0,,And now it's my turn!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:28.14,0:37:29.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Strong right!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:36.62,0:37:38.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Rocket Punch, go!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:42.02,0:37:43.84,Default,,0,0,0,,What are we supposed to do now?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:45.60,0:37:47.52,Default,,0,0,0,,They stopped running from us.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:49.70,0:37:51.86,Default,,0,0,0,,She's so sweet, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:52.72,0:37:53.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's be honest.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:54.28,0:37:56.78,Default,,0,0,0,,She's only sweet to kids, but that's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:57.38,0:37:59.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Just makes her sexier.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:03.78,0:38:05.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, Chopper.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:05.52,0:38:07.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Take Nami and get out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:08.72,0:38:11.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Right, I'll protect her. Wahoo!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:11.76,0:38:13.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen up, ankle biters.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:13.20,0:38:16.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Follow the beautiful lady\Nand the Kong fu raccoon.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:16.98,0:38:19.27,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll fight the guys who are chasing us.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:21.28,0:38:22.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's get one thing straight.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:23.38,0:38:25.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not doing any of this for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:25.36,0:38:29.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm just trying to help Nami carry\Nout her beautiful act of kindness.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:29.68,0:38:32.46,Default,,0,0,0,,If anything, I hate you\Nfor putting her in danger.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:32.54,0:38:34.38,Default,,0,0,0,,And because she likes you so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:34.46,0:38:36.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks for helping us, curly brow guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:36.50,0:38:37.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Start running! Hurry up!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:38.08,0:38:39.55,Default,,0,0,0,,You're just wasting time!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:40.26,0:38:41.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Cause it's going down!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:50.02,0:38:50.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Remarkable.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:51.04,0:38:55.16,Default,,0,0,0,,They were able to penetrate my\Nimpenetrable door. Huh? Master!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:57.98,0:39:02.04,Default,,0,0,0,,This burn mark, it looks like\Nit was caused by a laser.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:03.34,0:39:04.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought that Dr.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:04.86,0:39:08.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Vegapunk's pacifistas were the\Nonly things with that power.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:08.58,0:39:13.24,Default,,0,0,0,,At any rate, whoever these intruders\Nare, they're not to be trifled with.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:13.76,0:39:17.52,Default,,0,0,0,,That being said, I assume you\Nhaven't recaptured them yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:17.84,0:39:21.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Last I heard, they were corralling\Nthem into the biscuit room.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:21.44,0:39:22.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:22.35,0:39:24.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I suppose that could work.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:24.44,0:39:26.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Master, are you there? Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:27.20,0:39:28.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, go ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:29.12,0:39:31.64,Default,,0,0,0,,A navy ship is approaching\Nthe northwest shore.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:31.72,0:39:33.48,Default,,0,0,0,,It looks like they're with G5.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:33.56,0:39:34.62,Default,,0,0,0,,What should we do?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:35.14,0:39:37.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Turn them away and do it quickly.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:38.60,0:39:40.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Throw out some poison gas.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:40.38,0:39:41.48,Default,,0,0,0,,They'll get the idea,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:41.56,0:39:45.90,Default,,0,0,0,,but be certain not to kill them We\Nwouldn't want to start any trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:46.12,0:39:46.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir
Dialogue: 0,0:39:51.76,0:39:54.24,Default,,0,0,0,,You said there's ice and snow.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:55.10,0:39:56.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Indeed there is.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:57.04,0:39:59.84,Default,,0,0,0,,See when I awoke to find\Nthe ship in that condition.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:59.92,0:40:03.08,Default,,0,0,0,,It was quite a shock chilling\Nbone You might say wait,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:03.16,0:40:06.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean a chill boning shocker No,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:06.76,0:40:08.53,Default,,0,0,0,,it's chock-shocking something.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:08.86,0:40:09.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Never mind!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:12.34,0:40:15.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, darn it! Okay, wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:15.22,0:40:17.80,Default,,0,0,0,,You said there were these guys\Non the sunny when you woke up.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:17.88,0:40:18.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Who were they?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:27.40,0:40:28.23,Default,,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 0,0:40:28.31,0:40:29.52,Default,,0,0,0,,forgot to ask.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:30.88,0:40:33.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Probably should have\Nquestioned them first.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:34.26,0:40:35.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, well. Pity.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:38.12,0:40:39.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Terribly sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:39.30,0:40:40.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know a thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:41.52,0:40:44.74,Default,,0,0,0,,They're all wearing gas masks and\Nhave tanks on their backs, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:44.82,0:40:46.72,Default,,0,0,0,,A gas mask? Huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:46.94,0:40:50.38,Default,,0,0,0,,They likely use some sort of chemical\Nweapon to knock everyone out.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:50.46,0:40:54.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Then, in the meantime, they move the Sunny\Nover to the other side of the island.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:54.88,0:40:56.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn, you beat me!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:58.58,0:40:59.92,Default,,0,0,0,,You're too fast!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:01.80,0:41:05.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, your legs aren't\Nbuilt for running like mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:05.32,0:41:08.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, round two, come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:08.14,0:41:10.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Suit yourself, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:41:11.44,0:41:12.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:12.64,0:41:14.29,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:14.52,0:41:18.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, I can't find them You\Nsure the intruders are nearby?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:18.84,0:41:20.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I got nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:20.12,0:41:21.34,Default,,0,0,0,,There's a guy, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:21.42,0:41:24.32,Default,,0,0,0,,He's got talking legs, but he's one of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:24.40,0:41:26.08,Default,,0,0,0,,No, he's not, you moron!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:27.36,0:41:28.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Something wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:28.34,0:41:33.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm ready to do this what but the others I
Dialogue: 0,0:41:33.46,0:41:36.92,Default,,0,0,0,,do worry if they didn't\Nleave a note there's
Dialogue: 0,0:41:37.00,0:41:39.32,Default,,0,0,0,,only one answer they\Nwere taken by those men
Dialogue: 0,0:41:39.40,0:41:42.62,Default,,0,0,0,,in masks right and they\Ndidn't take you because
Dialogue: 0,0:41:42.70,0:41:45.60,Default,,0,0,0,,you look dead until you woke up instead of
Dialogue: 0,0:41:45.68,0:41:48.22,Default,,0,0,0,,feeling unwanted I suppose\NI should feel grateful
Dialogue: 0,0:41:48.30,0:41:51.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I might send help let's\Nbe quick look around
Dialogue: 0,0:41:52.06,0:41:55.24,Default,,0,0,0,,see anything like a\Nbuilding or you scarcely
Dialogue: 0,0:41:55.32,0:41:57.66,Default,,0,0,0,,need me at all Robin\Nit's like you can see it
Dialogue: 0,0:41:57.74,0:41:58.57,Default,,0,0,0,,yourself
Dialogue: 0,0:41:58.65,0:42:03.09,Default,,0,0,0,,there
Dialogue: 0,0:42:03.18,0:42:06.24,Default,,0,0,0,,is and
Dialogue: 0,0:42:06.32,0:42:09.28,Default,,0,0,0,,it's massive it's not a
Dialogue: 0,0:42:09.36,0:42:12.54,Default,,0,0,0,,restaurant i know that\Nmuch keep a low profile
Dialogue: 0,0:42:12.62,0:42:15.94,Default,,0,0,0,,we'll get there as soon\Nas possible roger oh
Dialogue: 0,0:42:16.02,0:42:19.54,Default,,0,0,0,,robin while i've got you on what kind of
Dialogue: 0,0:42:19.62,0:42:23.74,Default,,0,0,0,,panties are you think\Nthese guys work for the
Dialogue: 0,0:42:23.82,0:42:27.52,Default,,0,0,0,,government who knows but\Nthey're human So I guess
Dialogue: 0,0:42:27.60,0:42:30.42,Default,,0,0,0,,that's better than what\Nwe've been getting here.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:30.80,0:42:32.80,Default,,0,0,0,,A fire-breathing dragon?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:33.16,0:42:35.32,Default,,0,0,0,,A pair of talking legs?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:35.62,0:42:37.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Some bird woman?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:39.84,0:42:43.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Plus, that centaur guy\NLuffy made friends with.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:43.42,0:42:45.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Speaking of...
Dialogue: 0,0:42:45.46,0:42:49.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Try to trick me, will you? What? No, stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:54.76,0:42:57.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought you were one of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:59.86,0:43:01.86,Default,,0,0,0,,We were friends a second ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:02.16,0:43:04.42,Default,,0,0,0,,You're the one who started\Nswinging that club.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:04.50,0:43:05.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't blame me.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:06.76,0:43:08.60,Default,,0,0,0,,You're finished, sucker!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:09.22,0:43:10.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy, careful!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:11.70,0:43:13.68,Default,,0,0,0,,All right then, let me.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:14.28,0:43:15.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Snow Fleur!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:18.68,0:43:19.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Bellflower!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:31.14,0:43:32.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Giraffes? What's next?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:34.62,0:43:37.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Guess there's all kinds of\Ncentaurs out there, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:37.38,0:43:38.21,Default,,0,0,0,,That's funny.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:38.42,0:43:39.66,Default,,0,0,0,,It is not funny.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:39.86,0:43:43.10,Default,,0,0,0,,These guys are monsters and\Nthey're trying to kill you!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:45.94,0:43:47.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, he's got one, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:47.80,0:43:49.64,Default,,0,0,0,,And it says CC on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:49.98,0:43:52.32,Default,,0,0,0,,They're not just free-roaming\Nmagical creatures.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:52.40,0:43:54.40,Default,,0,0,0,,They're part of some organization.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:55.58,0:43:59.68,Default,,0,0,0,,What's worse, even if we tried to\Nget out of here, the Sunny is gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:00.02,0:44:04.02,Default,,0,0,0,,All we can do now is go to the frozen\Nside of the island and find Brooke.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:04.10,0:44:06.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Chopper, Nami, Sanji, Franky.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:07.26,0:44:08.62,Default,,0,0,0,,We've lost them all.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:09.62,0:44:10.62,Default,,0,0,0,,It is troubling.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:10.94,0:44:13.41,Default,,0,0,0,,They were all taken by those men in masks.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:13.74,0:44:17.28,Default,,0,0,0,,If they're passed out, the enemy\Ncould kill them at any time they like.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:17.36,0:44:18.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't say that!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:19.14,0:44:20.14,Default,,0,0,0,,What a mess.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:20.32,0:44:21.61,Default,,0,0,0,,We did this all wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:21.78,0:44:23.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Everything's happening on the frozen side.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:23.88,0:44:24.71,Default,,0,0,0,,We did fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:24.90,0:44:27.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I got to eat that big\Ndragon, and I met Dr.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:27.64,0:44:28.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Leggingston, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:28.55,0:44:30.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you say Leggingston?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:31.00,0:44:33.00,Default,,0,0,0,,That's what I named my new back leg.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:33.08,0:44:34.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Forget the snow cones.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:34.40,0:44:35.72,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a rescue mission.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:35.86,0:44:37.18,Default,,0,0,0,,And since I can't run away...
Dialogue: 0,0:44:37.26,0:44:38.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Guess I'm gonna fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:38.62,0:44:41.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I hope they sell\Nwarm coats over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:43.36,0:44:46.10,Default,,0,0,0,,And more likely, we'll\Njust all freeze to death.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:46.18,0:44:47.80,Default,,0,0,0,,It was nice knowing you.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:48.78,0:44:50.90,Default,,0,0,0,,The men are in danger, Vice Admiral.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:51.18,0:44:52.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't breathe.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:53.16,0:44:54.52,Default,,0,0,0,,This gas is everywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:54.98,0:44:56.40,Default,,0,0,0,,This got messy already.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:56.90,0:44:58.25,Default,,0,0,0,,What a dangerous place.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:58.40,0:45:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,In case you hadn't heard, Dr.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:00.08,0:45:03.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Vegapunk used to test his\Nchemical weapons on this island.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:03.26,0:45:05.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Then, they shut the operation\Ndown four years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:05.80,0:45:09.45,Default,,0,0,0,,If Straw Hat's here, I sure as\Nheck don't see his pirate ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:09.90,0:45:13.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Besides, the island's been a\Nhellhole since the accident.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:13.36,0:45:15.28,Default,,0,0,0,,No one can survive out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:16.60,0:45:17.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't buy it.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:18.80,0:45:21.70,Default,,0,0,0,,It's been too long and\Nthere's too much gas.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:21.98,0:45:23.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't understand, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:24.64,0:45:28.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Two years ago, there was no\Nsea of fire or sea of ice.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:28.70,0:45:30.76,Default,,0,0,0,,It was just a deserted island.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:30.84,0:45:35.96,Default,,0,0,0,,The toxic substances from the accident\Nwere already cleared out as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:36.80,0:45:42.16,Default,,0,0,0,,They had to be, otherwise Aokiji and\NAkainu wouldn't have held their duel here.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:42.58,0:45:45.10,Default,,0,0,0,,This island is the mark of their battle.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:00.88,0:46:07.50,Default,,0,0,0,,A struggle so great that the earth, the\Nsky, and the sea itself were transformed.
